> What is the best way of dealing with this.  Is he useful to keep
> around, or is it time for the wand of death?

Actually, provided you have reflection, it's time to laugh yourself
sick.  Just get to a place where there is a wall on the opposite side of
you from Orcus.  Then attack him.  He'll zap his wand o' death at you
(he always has one), it'll bounce off the wall behind you (or you, if he
actually hits you) and will kill him.  This is a never-ending source of
amusement for me.

> If he's not useful, why this following business?

He's not useful, he's annoying.  He's a demon lord, that's his job.  His
only use is to provide you with a wand of death (less one charge).

